<title>JAPAN: DKB confirms arrests, may hold news conference.</title>
<headline>DKB confirms arrests, may hold news conference.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's Dai-Ichi Kangyo Bank Ltd on Friday confirmed that two of its senior executives had been arrested, including vice president Ichiro Fujita.</p>
<p>A bank spokeswoman said the bank may hold a news conference later on Friday, but said a time has not yet been decided.</p>
</text>
